  <div class="finding" data-tags="standout">
    <div class="finding-meta">Session · DRT.FM strategic note</div>
    <div class="finding-body">
      <strong>DRT.FM call strategy crystallised from this session.</strong> Kindroid proved the face-animation approach works at scale — any character photo, faces + lips only, fast enough to feel real. DRT.FM path: adopt the same face-animation pipeline for calls (works on all characters automatically), layer Alexys-type deep memory on top, and keep the full 3D character as the in-app premium differentiator. One 3D character as the flagship; face-animation as the universal call mode for the rest. Best of both.
    </div>
