      <strong>Quality verdict:</strong> Standard loses realism noticeably. Dainis didn't like it. Premium is better but 2× the credit burn (~4k/min). The quality gap between Standard and Premium is the reason most users will stay on voice-only and never enable live video — the free tier isn't good enough to be compelling.
