      <strong>Homepage loads with "What's new on GirlfriendGPT" Beamer panel open in the right sidebar.</strong> Returning users immediately see what's changed since their last visit — latest changelog entry front-and-centre. Re-engagement mechanic: instead of logging in to a blank chat, you log in to news. Makes the product feel alive and actively maintained. Dainis: <em>"knowing what's updated is cool and handy — easier, more exciting to get back."</em>
